The bug was likely caused by the introduction of a `locale` parameter in the `TransfersTableAdapter` constructor, which was not properly handled in the context of the data being passed. This could lead to incorrect formatting of currency values, as the locale was not consistently applied or was unnecessary for the intended functionality. The removal of the `locale` parameter and the simplification of currency formatting suggest that the previous implementation was overly complex and prone to errors related to locale management.

